 [read('The red wolf of Bale',['The Ethiopian wolf lives only in the highlands of Ethiopia. Fifty years ago it was common, but its habitat became smaller as farms spread up the mountains. Dogs also spread diseases to the wolves.','In 2008 scientists were studying a pack in the Bale Mountains when they found that many wolves were sick. They vaccinated the wolves and taught local people to vaccinate their dogs. Today fewer than 500 Ethiopian wolves are left, so every one is precious.'],
  [eq('Where does the Ethiopian wolf live?','የኢትዮጵያ ቀበሮ የሚኖረው የት ነው?',['only in the Ethiopian highlands','all over Africa','in the desert']),eq('What harmed the wolves?','ቀበሮዎቹን የጎዳው?',['loss of habitat and dog diseases','too much food','cold weather only']),eq('What were scientists doing in 2008?','በ2008 ሳይንቲስቶቹ ምን እያደረጉ ነበር?',['studying a pack','building farms','hunting'])]),
  quiz(('Past simple and past continuous','Past simple እና past continuous'),('Past simple for finished actions: they found, it was. Past continuous (was/were + -ing) for an action in progress: they were studying. Use both together: They were studying when they found sick wolves.','Past simple ለተጠናቀቀ ድርጊት፦ they found, it was። Past continuous (was/were + -ing) በሂደት ላይ ለነበረ ድርጊት፦ they were studying። አብረው፦ They were studying when they found sick wolves።'),[
   sq('The rangers ___ when they saw the ibex.',['were walking','walked','walks']),sq('In 1970 the wolf ___ common.',['was','were','is']),sq('We ___ the gelada monkeys last year.',['saw','seed','were see']),sq('It ___ when we reached the park.',['was raining','rained by','is rain'])]),
  wm([('habitat','the natural home of an animal'),('endangered','in danger of disappearing'),('vaccinate','to protect from disease with medicine'),('ranger','a person who protects a park')])],
